──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
nclaunch 1> helo
**ERROR: (RFN-CMD-404): Unknown command 'helo'.  Type 'help' for the command list.
nclaunch 2> help
─── Compile ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  compile               Lint/parse the current design + testbench sources
  elaborate             Build the simulation executable (ncelab, xmelab)
  read_hdl              Add design sources (ncvlog, xmvlog)
  read_tb               Add testbench sources
─── Simulate ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  simulate              Run the simulation (-gui opens waves afterwards) (ncsim, xmsim, run)
  xrun                  One-shot compile+elaborate+simulate (irun, ncverilog)
─── Software ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  report_memories       Memories in the design that a program can be loaded into (sw_memories)
  sw_build              Compile a bare-metal RISC-V program with RTLFlow's start-up code and runtime (riscv_build)
  sw_load               Put a program into a memory of the design for the next simulate (load_program)
  sw_test               Run the riscv-tests ISA suite (rv32ui/um/ua/uc for -march) on the core (riscv_tests)
─── UVM ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  list_tests            UVM tests found in the testbench sources
  regress               Run tests × random seeds, summary + merged functional coverage
  report_uvm            UVM messages of the last run
  run_cocotb            Run a Python UVM (pyuvm + cocotb) testbench
  run_test              Run a UVM test (builds first if needed)
  set_uvm               Compile with the UVM library (auto = when the TB imports uvm_pkg)
  uvm_gen               Generate a complete UVM testbench (agent, scoreboard, coverage, tests) for a DUT
─── Coverage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  report_coverage       Functional (RFCOV) + code coverage
  set_coverage          Verilator line/toggle code coverage (--coverage)
─── Waves ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  simvision             Open the waveform viewer (GTKWave / Surfer) (waves, gtkwave)
─── Session ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  clear_sources         Forget all sources
  set_engine            Choose simulator
  status                Simulation setup
─── Shell ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  cd                    Change directory
  exit                  Leave this tool (quit, exit_tool)
  export                Set an environment variable (bash style)
  getenv                Print an environment variable
  help                  List commands or show help for one
  history               Show command history
  man                   Show usage for a command
  puts                  Print text
  pwd                   Print working directory
  set                   Set or print a variable
  set_theme             GUI colour theme for every RTLFlow window (open ones switch within ~2 s) (theme)
  setenv                Set an environment variable
  sh                    Run a Unix command
  source                Run a script of commands
─── GUI ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  gui_hide              Close the GUI (session keeps running)
  gui_show              Open this tool's GUI (same session) (gui, win)

  man <command> for usage · any unknown line is an error unless the tool forwards it to its backend
